{"title": "Needle Burst", "pageid": 17856, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Needle_Burst", "categories": ["Class actions", "Dexterity saving throws", "Sources of Piercing damage", "Sources of Necrotic damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Damage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp/300px-Generic_Damage.webp, /w/images/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp/300px-Generic_Damage.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Needle Burst</b> is a class action used by <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Needle_Blight\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Needle Blight\">Shadow-Cursed Needle Blight</a> when they die.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nExplode in a barrage of needles.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt>Damage: 7~52</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:9px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:1;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/40px-D8_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/53px-D8_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/D8_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 40%, -30%) rotate(20deg)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/31px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/46px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/62px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/31px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">6d8</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save (DC&nbsp;11)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;11) (On Save: Targets still take half damage.)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\